2026-10-17T00:48:31.4268034Z   "announcement_changelog": "### ⛰️ Features\n\n- *(code)* Make slash launcher the primary control ([#935](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/pull/935)) - ([343d8f9](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/commit/343d8f984838d0eee3699910ad9a4a5cc4012f1b))\n- *(extensions)* [**breaking**] Add native request-check host ([#923](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/pull/923)) - ([750d618](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/commit/750d618ad4235adefaaa33e4d864ef61169440fd))\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Sync registry catalog ([#937](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/pull/937)) - ([27574c5](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/commit/27574c5fea312035cacea5ad2db6a5081bc007ec))",
2026-10-17T00:48:31.4298726Z   "announcement_github_body": "## Release Notes\n\n### ⛰️ Features\n\n- *(code)* Make slash launcher the primary control ([#935](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/pull/935)) - ([343d8f9](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/commit/343d8f984838d0eee3699910ad9a4a5cc4012f1b))\n- *(extensions)* [**breaking**] Add native request-check host ([#923](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/pull/923)) - ([750d618](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/commit/750d618ad4235adefaaa33e4d864ef61169440fd))\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Sync registry catalog ([#937](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/pull/937)) - ([27574c5](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/commit/27574c5fea312035cacea5ad2db6a5081bc007ec))\n\n## Install bitrouter 1.0.0-alpha.33\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install bitrouter/tap/bitrouter\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project\n\n```sh\nnpm install bitrouter@1.0.0-alpha.33\n```\n\n## Download bitrouter 1.0.0-alpha.33\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [bitrouter-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bitrouter-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bitrouter-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [bitrouter-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bitrouter-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bitrouter-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/bitrouter/bitrouter/releases/download/v1.0.0-alpha.33/bitrouter-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n",
